Vigor, Greater	KEY:Vigor (Greater)	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Conjuration	SUBSCHOOL:Healing	COMPS:V, S	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:Living creature touched	DURATION:(min(CASTERLEVEL,25)+10) rounds	SAVEINFO:Will negates (harmless)	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless)	CLASSES:Cleric,Druid=5	DESC:Same as lesser vigor except it grants target fast healing ability for the duration of the spell at 4 hp automatically healed per round.	SOURCELONG:Complete Divine	SOURCESHORT:CD	SOURCEPAGE:p.186	SOURCEDATE:2004-05
Vigor, Lesser	KEY:Vigor (Lesser)	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Conjuration	SUBSCHOOL:Healing	COMPS:V, S	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Touch	ITEM:Potion	TARGETAREA:Living creature touched	DURATION:(min(CASTERLEVEL,5)+10) rounds	SAVEINFO:Will negates (harmless)	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless)	CLASSES:Cleric,Druid=1	DESC:Grants target fast healing ability for the duration of the spell. Heals 1 hp automatically per round.	SOURCELONG:Complete Divine	SOURCESHORT:CD	SOURCEPAGE:p.186	SOURCEDATE:2004-05
Vigor, Mass Lesser	KEY:Vigor (Mass Lesser)	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Conjuration	SUBSCHOOL:Healing	COMPS:V, S	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:20 ft.	ITEM:Potion	TARGETAREA:(min(CASTERLEVEL)/2) creatures, no two of which can be more than 30 ft. apart	DURATION:(min(CASTERLEVEL,15)+10) rounds	SAVEINFO:Will negates (harmless)	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless)	CLASSES:Cleric,Druid=3	DESC:Same as lesser vigor except it grants all targets fast healing ability for the duration of the spell at 1 hp automatically healed per round.	SOURCELONG:Complete Divine	SOURCESHORT:CD	SOURCEPAGE:p.186-187	SOURCEDATE:2004-05
Vigorous Circle	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Conjuration	SUBSCHOOL:Healing	COMPS:V, S	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:20 ft.	TARGETAREA:(min(CASTERLEVEL)/2) creatures, no two of which can be more than 30 ft. apart	DURATION:(min(CASTERLEVEL,30)+10) rounds	SAVEINFO:Will negates (harmless)	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless)	CLASSES:Cleric,Druid=6	DESC:Same as mass lesser vigor except it grants all targets fast healing ability for the duration of the spell at 3 hp automatically healed per round.	SOURCELONG:Complete Divine	SOURCESHORT:CD	SOURCEPAGE:p.187	SOURCEDATE:2004-05
Visage of the Deity	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Transmutation	DESCRIPTOR:Good|Evil	COMPS:V, S, DF	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Personal	TARGETAREA:You	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) rounds	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:No	CLASSES:Cleric=6	DESC:Your form becomes more like your deity's, take on celestial or fiendish qualities; see text	SOURCELONG:Complete Divine	SOURCESHORT:CD	SOURCEPAGE:p.187	SOURCEDATE:2004-05
Visage of the Deity, Greater	KEY:Visage of the Deity (Greater)	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Transmutation	DESCRIPTOR:Good|Evil	COMPS:V, S, DF	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Personal	TARGETAREA:You	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) rounds	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:No	CLASSES:Cleric=9	DESC:Your form becomes more like your deity's - become half-celestial or half-fiend; see text	SOURCELONG:Complete Divine	SOURCESHORT:CD	SOURCEPAGE:p.187	SOURCEDATE:2004-05
