Wave of Grief	TYPE:Arcane.Divine	SCHOOL:Enchantment	DESCRIPTOR:Evil|Mind-Affecting	COMPS:S, M	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Close	ITEM:Potion	TARGETAREA:Cone	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) rounds	SAVEINFO:Will negates	SPELLRES:Yes	CLASSES:Bard,Blackguard,Cleric=2	DESC:Targets become overwhelmed with grief. They suffer a -3 morale penalty on all attack rolls, saving throws, ability checks, and skill checks.	SOURCELONG:Complete Divine	SOURCESHORT:CD	SOURCEPAGE:p.188	SOURCEDATE:2004-05
Weapon of the Deity	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Transmutation	COMPS:V, DF	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:0 ft.	TARGETAREA:One weapon you hold	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) rounds	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:No	CLASSES:Blackguard,Cleric,Paladin=4	DESC:Imbue a weapon favored by your deity with special enhancements and abilities. See text.	SOURCELONG:Complete Divine	SOURCESHORT:CD	SOURCEPAGE:p.188	SOURCEDATE:2004-05
Weather Eye	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Divination	COMPS:V, S, M, DF	CASTTIME:1 hour	RANGE:(CASTERLEVEL+1) miles	ITEM:Potion	TARGETAREA: (CASTERLEVEL+1) miles, centered on you	DURATION:Instantaneous	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:No	CLASSES:Druid=3|Cleric=4	DESC:You may accurately predict the natural weather up to one week into the future. If unnatural forces currently affect the weather then the spell acts as detect magic.	SOURCELONG:Complete Divine	SOURCESHORT:CD	SOURCEPAGE:p.189	SOURCEDATE:2004-05
